          {
            "title": "Question 1",
            "id": 75856,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual è la parola chiave che decide se un blocco di codice deve essere eseguito o meno?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>if</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>when</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>for</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>if</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un gioco deve mostrare un messaggio solo quando <code>game_over</code> è <code>True</code>. Quale riga deve avviare il controllo?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>if game_over:</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>when game_over:</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>for game_over:</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>if game_over:</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 5",
            "id": 75894,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scrivi il codice della variabile che visualizza <code>\"Take an umbrella\"</code> nella console.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"is_rainy = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"is_sunny = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" is_rainy:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Take an umbrella&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"is_sunny\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Take an umbrella\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>is_rainy</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Imposta <code>is_rainy</code> in modo che il suo blocco venga eseguito. Usa la variabile come condizione per stampare <code>Take an umbrella</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"is_rainy = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"is_sunny = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" is_rainy:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Take an umbrella&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"is_sunny\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Take an umbrella\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>True</code>, seguito da <code>is_rainy</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 6",
            "id": 75863,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che tipo di valore usiamo come condizione per un'istruzione if?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Boolean</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">String</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Numero</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere Boolean.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Puoi usare un valore booleano memorizzato come condizione di un’istruzione <code>if</code>.</p><p>La variabile <code>is_open</code> memorizza <code>False</code>. Quale espressione restituisce quel valore booleano?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>is_open</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"is_open\"</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>0</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>is_open</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 5",
            "id": 75864,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>In base all'indentazione, quando verrà eseguito <code>print(\"Starting game ...\")</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"character = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Wizard&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" character == \" /><text value=\"&quot;Knight&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Weapon: sword&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Starting game ...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sempre, indipendentemente dal fatto che il blocco <code>if</code> venga eseguito, perché è indentato allo stesso livello</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Solo quando viene eseguito il blocco <code>if</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Mai, perché questo codice genera un <code>IndentationError</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Sempre, indipendentemente dal fatto che il blocco <code>if</code> venga eseguito, perché è indentato allo stesso livello.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Esegui il codice con <code>character</code> impostato su <code>\"Wizard\"</code>. Che cosa visualizza?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"character = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Wizard&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" character == \" /><text value=\"&quot;Knight&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Weapon: sword&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Starting game ...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Solo <code>Starting game ...</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Prima <code>Weapon: sword</code>, poi <code>Starting game ...</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Nulla, perché la condizione è <code>False</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Solo <code>Starting game ...</code></p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 4",
            "id": 75858,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come chiamiamo le istruzioni che eseguono o saltano del codice a seconda che una condizione sia <code>True</code> o <code>False</code>?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Istruzioni if</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Istruzioni else</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Cicli for</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Istruzioni if.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>is_member</code> memorizza <code>False</code>. Cosa fa <code>if is_member:</code> con il messaggio di benvenuto indentato?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Salta il messaggio di benvenuto.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Stampa il messaggio di benvenuto perché is_member esiste.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Stampa False invece del messaggio di benvenuto.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Salta il messaggio di benvenuto.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Correct answers",
            "id": 76588,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name == \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hi Sue!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Hi Sue!\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Hi Sue!</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nulla, la condizione è <code>False</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Sue</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Hi Sue!</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perché questo codice visualizza <code>Hi Sue!</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name == \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hi Sue!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Hi Sue!\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Il confronto è <code>True</code>, quindi viene eseguito il <code>print()</code> indentato.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Il confronto cambia <code>name</code> in <code>\"Sue\"</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Il <code>print()</code> viene eseguito indipendentemente dalla condizione perché è fuori dal blocco.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Il confronto è <code>True</code>, quindi viene eseguito il <code>print()</code> indentato.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Condition",
            "id": 76566,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"weather = \" /><text value=\"&quot;rainy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"color_code = \" /><text value=\"&quot;yellow&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" weather == \" /><text value=\"&quot;rainy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  color_code = \" /><text value=\"&quot;blue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(color_code)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"blue\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>blue</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>yellow</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>color_code</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>blue</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perché questo codice visualizza <code>blue</code> invece di <code>yellow</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"weather = \" /><text value=\"&quot;rainy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"color_code = \" /><text value=\"&quot;yellow&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" weather == \" /><text value=\"&quot;rainy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  color_code = \" /><text value=\"&quot;blue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(color_code)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"blue\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">La condizione è <code>True</code>, quindi <code>color_code</code> cambia prima di essere stampato.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">La condizione è <code>False</code>, quindi <code>color_code</code> conserva il primo valore.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>print()</code> visualizza il nome della variabile invece del valore attuale.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">La condizione è <code>True</code>, quindi <code>color_code</code> cambia prima di essere stampato.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Wrong answers",
            "id": 76544,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scrivi una condizione che esegua l'istruzione di visualizzazione solo se <code>character</code> è <em>diverso</em> da <code>\"Wizard\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"character = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Wizard&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" character != \" /><text value=\"&quot;Wizard&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You can't use spells&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>character</code>, seguito da <code>!=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Il blocco viene eseguito solo se <code>character</code> <em>non</em> è <code>\"Wizard\"</code>. Crea il controllo in modo che questa esecuzione non stampi nulla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"character = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Wizard&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" character != \" /><text value=\"&quot;Wizard&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You can't use spells&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>character</code>, seguito da <code>!=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
